  C Array Programs 

These are the array programs I worked through  while practicing C. 


int a[5];
int ele = sizeof(a) / sizeof(a[0]);   // number of elements in the array


sizeof(a) gives the size of the whole array in bytes, and dividing by sizeof(a[0]) gives the count. This way I don't have to hard-code the size in every loop.

 Programs

1. Even numbers from an array
2. Power of 2 numbers from an array
3. Prime numbers from an array
4. Reverse an array by swapping
5. Swap adjacent elements
6. Rotate an array right by one
7. Largest element
